{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40473","headline":"赠镜湖处士方干二首 二 · 曹松","name":"赠镜湖处士方干二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秪拟应星眠越绝，唯将丽什当高勳。\n磨砻清浊人难会，织络虚无帝亦闻。\n鸟道未知山足雨，渔家已没镜中云。\n他时莫爲三徴起，门外沙鸥解笑君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40473.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40473","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}